__␀",u:1787000929565,s:"success",l:$R[3]={guideTrends:void 0},ssr:!0},$R[4]={i:"␀$username␀status␀$id␀␀Efloud␀status␀1985997695866019951␀{}",u:1787000929732,s:"success",l:$R[5]={conversationOptions:$R[6]={rankingMode:void 0},metadata:$R[7]={authorAvatarUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_normal.jpg",authorDescription:"Sup bro? \nMostly TA, rarely FA. \nAlways chill out. \nTweets are not financial/investment advice. \n15.09.1966",authorName:"Efloud",focalTweetId:"1985997695866019951",hasArticle:!1,headMetadata:$R[8]={appLinkUrl:"twitter://status?id=1985997695866019951",articleTags:void 0,author:$R[9]={image:$R[10]={alt:"Efloud profile picture",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg"},screenName:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},bodyText:"$ETH | Destek &amp; Direnç Güncellemesi\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nFiyat, araştırma raporunda verdiğim destek bölgesi olan $3150'den reaksiyon aldı (grafik üzerindeki nottan teyit edebilirsiniz) lakin YO (Yearly Open) kazanılmadıkça pariteye dair sıkıntılar devam edecektir.\n\nFiyatın YO kazanımı https://t.co/M2Czeed9Ay",canonicalPath:"/Efloud/status/1985997695866019951",canonicalUrl:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/1985997695866019951",description:"$ETH | Destek &amp; Direnç Güncellemesi\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nFiyat, araştırma raporunda verdiğim destek bölgesi olan $3150'den reaksiyon aldı (grafik üzerindeki nottan teyit edebilirsiniz) lakin YO (Yearly Open) kazanılmadıkça pariteye dair sıkıntılar devam edecektir.\n\nFiyatın YO kazanımı",faviconUrl:void 0,hasAiGeneratedMedia:void 0,image:$R[11]={alt:void 0,height:1770,isContent:!0,preloadUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4-t-rEXcAEb7Zs?format=webp&name=medium",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4-t-rEXcAEb7Zs.jpg:large",width:3286},isAdult:!1,isArticle:!1,jsonLd:$R[12]=[$R[13]={"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://x.com/i/status/1985997695866019951","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[14]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},comment:$R[15]=[$R[16]={"@id":"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/1986003953562140692","@type":"Comment",author:$R[17]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"cryptotiks",identifier:"1423650245939011593",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609620971882778626/4ZfJlskr_400x400.jpg",name:"Kriptotiks👁‍🗨",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2025-11-05T09:33:35.000Z",identifier:"1986003953562140692",interactionStatistic:$R[18]=[$R[19]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/1986003953562140692/likes",userInteractionCount:6},$R[20]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/1986003953562140692/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[21]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[22]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:1846}],text:"@efloud Yükselişler hep fakeout kalıyor hocam bir süredir momentum eksikliğinden. Ben bunu global çapta tepede olmamızdan kaynaklı risk iştahının sınırlandırılmasına bağlıyorum. \n\nGlobal realizasyon sonrası geçmek için 3800 üstünü riskli gördü piyasa. \n\nBize momentumlu tek mum lazım."},$R[23]={"@id":"https://x.com/Skymerchant/status/1986019653097861293","@type":"Comment",author:$R[24]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Skymerchant",identifier:"2283809483",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089263839124557824/5TLdaGNw_400x400.jpg",name:"極める",url:"https://x.com/Skymerchant"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2025-11-05T10:35:58.000Z",identifier:"1986019653097861293",interactionStatistic:$R[25]=[$R[26]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/Skymerchant/status/1986019653097861293/likes",userInteractionCount:3},$R[27]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/Skymerchant/status/1986019653097861293/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[28]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[29]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:1361}],text:"@efloud seviyoruz"}],commentCount:27,identifier:"1985997695866019951",interactionStatistic:$R[30]=[$R[31]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/1985997695866019951/likes",userInteractionCount:416},$R[32]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/1985997695866019951/retweets",userInteractionCount:25},$R[33]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:27},$R[34]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:68723}],sharedContent:$R[35]={"@id":"https://x.com/i/status/1982765450854289903","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[36]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},identifier:"1982765450854289903",text:"$ETH | LTF Pozisyon Güncellemesi &amp; Yeni Fikirler\n\nMerhabalar, iyi haftalar.\n\nGüncel Durum:\n#ETH nezdinde kalan pozisyonumun %20'sini buradan %12 kâr ve 9.71 R ile kapatmış bulunuyorum.\nBir önceki analizde 3.92 R ile pozisyonumun %80'ini kapatmıştım.\nToplam R'ı hesapladığımda"},text:"$ETH | Destek &amp; Direnç Güncellemesi\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nFiyat, araştırma raporunda verdiğim destek bölgesi olan $3150'den reaksiyon aldı (grafik üzerindeki nottan teyit edebilirsiniz) lakin YO (Yearly Open) kazanılmadıkça pariteye dair sıkıntılar devam edecektir.\n\nFiyatın YO kazanımı"}],mediaPreviewImageUrl:"https://jf.x.com/images/media-preview/1985997695866019951",publishedTime:"2025-11-05T09:08:43.000Z",replyCount:27,socialTitle:"Efloud (@Efloud) on X",title:"Efloud on X: \"$ETH | Destek &amp; Direnç Güncellemesi\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nFiyat, araştırma raporunda verdiğim destek bölgesi olan $3150'den reaksiyon aldı (grafik üzerindeki nottan teyit edebilirsiniz) lakin YO (Yearly Open) kazanılmadıkça pariteye dair sıkıntılar devam edecektir.\n\nFiyatın YO kazanımı\""},replyCount:27,screenName:"Efloud",status:"available",text:"$ETH | Destek &amp; Direnç Güncellemesi\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nFiyat, araştırma raporunda verdiğim destek bölgesi olan $3150'den reaksiyon aldı (grafik üzerindeki nottan teyit edebilirsiniz) lakin YO (Yearly Open) kazanılmadıkça pariteye dair sıkıntılar devam edecektir.\n\nFiyatın YO kazanımı https://t.co/M2Czeed9Ay"},isSinglePost:!1},ssr:!0}],dehydratedData:$R[37]={relayRecords:$R[38]={"client:root":$R[39]={__id:"client:root",__typename:"__Root","threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2(focal_tweet_id:\"1985997695866019951\")":$R[40]={__ref:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline"},"tweet_result_by_rest_id(rest_id:\"1985997695866019951\",safety_level:\"TweetDetail\")":$R[41]={__ref:"TweetResults:1985997695866019951"},"__threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2_urt(focal_tweet_id:\"1985997695866019951\")":$R[42]={__ref:"client:root:__threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2_urt(focal_tweet_id:\"1985997695866019951\")"}},"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline":$R[43]={__id:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline",__typename:"TimelineTimeline",id:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline",response_objects:null,instructions:$R[44]={__refs:$R[45]=["client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Ti